WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:04.004
The bakery opens at six.

2
00:00:04.254 --> 00:00:06.757
The first bread comes out
of the oven at seven.

3
00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.968 line:0
<i>[oven door creaks]</i>

4
00:00:10.052 --> 00:00:12.513
Rye bread takes <b>four</b> hours.

5
00:00:12.554 --> 00:00:15.015
Wheat bread takes <u>two</u>.

6
00:00:15.349 --> 00:00:17.851
<c.yellow>BAKER:</c> Mind the hot tray.

7
00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.479 line:0
Sign: Fresh rolls
every morning

8
00:00:21.104 --> 00:00:23.941
<i>The shop closes at noon.</i>
